citepostbag"},{"issue":"40","letter":"Letter 2","author":"Idria","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"47","letter":"Letter 5","name":"postbag","author":"Wahisietel","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"38","letter":"Letter 5","author":"Azzanadra","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"14","letter":"Letter 3","author":"Crunchy, Tim and Eski","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"14","letter":"Letter 3","author":"Crunchy, Tim and Eski","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"1","letter":"Letter 3","author":"Crunchy","quote":"My name is Crunchy I'll have you know! Do I like being a skeleton you ask? I was once an adventurer like you, slaying dragons, cutting trees, and fishing... until I was challenged to a duel by a POWERFUL mage, creator of worlds! I was too proud to pass up the challenge and was beaten. He plucked me from the world and made me stand here with this sign. I didn’t want to be the gate keeper for RuneScape you know. They don’t even feed me, my room mate hasn’t had a shower in 3 years and my arms hurt... help!","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"25","letter":"Letter 1","author":"Ug","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"44","letter":"Letter 3","author":"Thok","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"44","letter":"Wise Old Tips","author":"Wise Old Man","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"44","author":"Marmaros","letter":"Letter 2","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"44","letter":"Letter 1","author":"Yk'Lagor","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"44","letter":"Letter 4","author":"Azzanadra","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"44","author":"D","letter":"Wise Old Tips","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"35","letter":"Letter 1","author":"Blokey Simms","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"16","letter":"Letter 7","name":"postbag","author":"Nigall","template":"citepostbag"},{"author":"The Amasin' Rodolfo","issue":"37","letter":"Letter 3","name":"postbag","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"47","letter":"Letter 4","author":"Tam McGrubor","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"47","author":"Queen Black Dragon","letter":"Letter 3","name":"Postbag 47","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"23","letter":"Letter 5","author":"Skuhavi","name":"postbag","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"23","letter":"Letter 5","author":"Skuhavi","name":"postbag","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"13","letter":"Letter 4","author":"Evil Chicken","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"37","letter":"Letter 4","author":"Bighead","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"23","letter":"Letter 5","author":"Skuhavi","name":"postbag","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"41","letter":"Letter 4","author":"Thurgo","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"3","author":"Jabbaz","letter":"Letter 3","name":"Postbag 3","template":"citepostbag"},{"issue":"8","author":"Slime in the Pool of Ectofuntus","letter":"2","notes":"\"Well, the fact is that we have been evolving for many an age, and we have only been able to jump for the last millennia, give or take an eon or twelve. Hopefully in a few more we will be able to jump up all of those stairs and get out of this strange temple. It's weird, climbing up them is pure torture, but slinking back down seems almost natural, and rather fun. You should try it one day. Food and gods are things we are not familiar with, we don’t get out into the Slimelight much.\"","template":"citepostbag"}]